<div class="page-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">GROW YOUR CIRCLE. SHARE YOUR CURIOSITY.</span><h1>Good skills are worth sharing.</h1><p>A small invitation can be the start of someone’s next chapter.</p></div><span class="icon-tile orange"><?= icon('gift',25) ?></span></div><section class="referral-hero"><span class="eyebrow orange-text">BETTER WHEN LEARNED TOGETHER</span><h2>Bring a friend.<br>Build a little momentum.</h2><p>Share your unique invitation link. When an active campaign’s conditions are met, eligible referrals can earn the configured platform reward.</p><?= icon('gift',85) ?><div class="referral-link-box"><input id="referral-link" value="<?= e(route_url('/register?ref=' . ($code))) ?>" readonly aria-label="Your referral invitation link"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-copy="referral"><?= icon('copy',15) ?> Copy link</button></div><p class="fine-print" style="margin-top:13px">Your code: <strong class="mono"><?= e($code) ?></strong> · Platform rewards only. No cash is promised.</p></section>
<div class="two-column"><section class="card table-card"><div class="card-pad" style="padding-bottom:0"><div class="card-header"><div><h2>Your little ripple effect.</h2><p>Referral progress without exposing another learner’s private records.</p></div><span class="badge badge-neutral"><?= $total ?> signups</span></div></div><?php if($referrals): ?><div class="table-responsive"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Invitation</th><th>Joined</th><th>Eligibility</th><th>Reward</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($referrals as $r): ?><tr><td>Referral #<?= (int)$r['id'] ?></td><td><?= niceDate($r['created_at'],'M j, Y') ?></td><td><?= badge($r['status']) ?></td><td><?= $r['amount']!==null?number($r['amount']).' '.e(strtoupper($r['reward_type'])):'Not awarded' ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><?php pagination($total); ?><?php else: emptyState('users','Your first invitation starts here.','Copy your link and share it with someone who has a little curiosity to follow.');endif; ?></section><aside class="card card-pad"><div class="card-header"><h2>Clear rules. Shared progress.</h2><?= icon('shield',19) ?></div><?php if($campaign): ?><h3 style="font-size:16px;margin-bottom:17px"><?= e($campaign['title']) ?></h3><div class="key-value"><span>Your eligible reward</span><strong><?= number($campaign['referrer_reward']) ?> <?= e(strtoupper($campaign['reward_type'])) ?></strong></div><div class="key-value"><span>Your friend’s reward</span><strong><?= number($campaign['referred_reward']) ?> <?= e(strtoupper($campaign['reward_type'])) ?></strong></div><div class="key-value"><span>Lessons your friend completes</span><strong><?= (int)$campaign['qualifying_lessons'] ?></strong></div><div class="key-value"><span>Verified email required</span><strong><?= $campaign['require_verified']?'Yes':'No' ?></strong></div><div class="key-value"><span>Reward cap per learner</span><strong><?= (int)$campaign['max_rewards'] ?></strong></div><?php if($campaign['ends_at']): ?><div class="key-value"><span>Campaign ends</span><strong><?= niceDate($campaign['ends_at']) ?></strong></div><?php endif; ?><p class="fine-print" style="margin-top:18px">Both accounts must be active. Rewards are issued once after verified server-side conditions are met. Self-referrals, duplicate accounts and manipulated activity are not eligible.</p><?php else: ?><div class="mini-empty"><?= icon('gift',29) ?><p>No reward campaign is currently active. You can still invite friends, but no reward is promised or issued until an eligible campaign is configured.</p></div><?php endif; ?></aside></div>
